{"id":"f2db5acb5344c257","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pa-degree.md","title":"PA 度的路径性质","display":"df-pa-degree — PA 度的路径性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pa-degree","aliases":["20-df-pa-degree"],"display":"df-pa-degree — PA 度的路径性质","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(v)（等价定义）","source_pdf_pages":[217],"source_printed_pages":[185],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-deg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pa-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pa-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa-degree — PA 度的路径性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(v)（等价定义）"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf a\">\\(A\\in\\mathbf a\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in C\\ (X\\le_TA)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in C\\ (X\\le_TA)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Theorem 10.3.3 中的等价刻画，用作本地定义便于先讨论路径；它与“计算一个 PA 的完整一致延伸”在另一原子中核对。这里是计算某个成员，不是说 A 自身属于每个类。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(v)（等价定义）；印刷页 185；PDF 第 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbf a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in C\\ (X\\le_TA)].","display":true}],"bytes":1232,"backlinks":[{"id":"63a9c41255fee3d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]。"},{"id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension]]；see [[20-thm-binary-extension-path]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"构造与来源：[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]、[[20-thm-minimal-below-ce]]、[[20-thm-relative-complement]]、[[20-df-pa-degree]]、[[20-thm-ad-cone]]。极小度存在性构造仍需补证。"}],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","c98b19cc764c238f"]}